.
.  Macro to generate geometric representation of 2x2 design
.  with sample response values
.
device 1 x11
device 2 gd jpeg
device 2 picture points 200 200
.
limits -1 1
major tic mark number 2
minor tic mark number 0
tic offset 0 0
.
x1label X1
y1label X2
label size 5
tic label size 5
.
read x y tag
-0.9 -0.9  1
 0.9 -0.9  2
 0.9  0.9  3
-0.9  0.9  4
end of data
character 2 4 8 6
character size 5 all
line bl bl bl bl
.
plot y x tag
.
